      "content": "It sounds like you are convinced that your absence would bring them peace, and that idea of \"selfless\" is a very strong pull right now. But true selflessness isn't about disappearing; it's about finding a way to stop hurting yourself so you stop hurting them. If you're feeling this desperate, it means the pain inside is too much to bear, and that's a signal that you need immediate, real-world help to manage it. Please reach out to a crisis line right now.",
